'''Catnip Challenges''', '''Cat Missions''' (にゃんこミッション, ''Nyanko Misshon''), or simply '''Missions''', are a quest-type feature added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]]. Missions can be accessed from the [[Cat Base Menu]] at any time.

==Explanation==
:''There are 4 tabs of missions called '''Main''' (メイン), '''Weekly''' (ウィークリー), '''Monthly '''(マンスリー) and '''Special''' (スペシャル).''
<gallery hideaddbutton = "true">
pre 6.2 SoL Menu.jpg|before 6.2
6.2 new SoL menu.jpg|6.2 onward
</gallery>
By completing certain tasks, the player can gain various rewards. The Missions feature is located in the Cat Base Menu, below the 'Start', 'Upgrade' and 'Equip' buttons. [[Catclaw Dojo]] was previously there, in an earlier update. If a one-time task is already completed when a new Mission is given, the reward is automatically granted.

==Main Missions==
Main missions have no time limit, they can be done and the rewards can be received at any time. These missions can only be done once.
