==Monthly Missions==
Monthly missions are available for 30 days. They reset at 00:00 on the first day of each month and end at 23:59 on the last day of each month. All rewards must be claimed before the deadline or else they will be lost.

There are 33 stages in total, but only 30 need to be completed. The missions all follow a format of "defeat X enemy once at Y chapter", starting at [[Empire of Cats]] Ch. 2 and progressing to later [[Main Chapters Levels|chapters]] and Levels of [[Stories of Legend]] as you complete the missions. The enemies that need to be defeated are chosen randomly every time, but there are rules in place to ensure that certain enemies that will never be chosen:
*Enemies not appearing in the chapter you have to play.
*[[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] enemies ([[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] may still need to be defeated in Legend Stages).
*Event enemies other than [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, which have to be fought in their [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|initial stages]].
*[[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Enemy Bases]] and anything else that doesn't have an Enemy Guide entry.

