==Weekly Missions==
Weekly missions are available for 7 days from 00:00 on Monday to 23:59 on Sunday. All rewards must be claimed before the deadline or else they will be lost.
<gallery hideaddbutton="true">
mission-weekly-1.jpg
mission-weekly-2.jpg
</gallery>There are five different types of weekly missions, but only four will appear each week. Upon completion of the four weekly missions, the player can claim the weekly reward.

