==Special Missions==
These are missions that works in conjunction with limited-time events such as Collaboration events, and Monthly Rewards for upgrading certain Item Drop units. Rewards must be collected within the time limit or during the Monthly Events. There are 312 special missions as of [[Version 14.6 Update|14.6]].
